Package: DiffPTM
Type: Package
Title: Differential Abundance and Usage Analysis of Post-Translational Modifications
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Quentin", "Giai Gianetto", email = "quentin.giaigianetto@pasteur.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Zina", "Salhi", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Quality control, normalisation, imputation and differential analysis of
    PTM-enriched (phospho, ubiquitin, acetyl, ...) and total-proteome quantitative
    proteomics data. Separates changes in PTM abundance from changes in PTM usage
    (i.e. corrected for the parent protein) with three interchangeable statistical
    methods (limma single model, MSstatsPTM, msqrob2PTM) run on one common data model,
    and provides a Shiny interface with reproducible reports.
